verify.prompt:
Verify the restart of {{input.service}} against the baseline:
{{state.precheck}}

Restart result:
{{state.restart}}

Read-only: service_control status, probe the service, logs_search the last 5 minutes, ops_check for the service. It is VERIFIED when it runs, is healthy, the probe passes and no new errors appear; otherwise FAILED.

Report: the checks and their numbers against the baseline.
